| P05 observations | Raw execution quarantine и negative sink/reentry consumers: [runtime](../../artifacts/v6/iteration-20261007-p05-execution-quarantine-observation/report.md), [negative consumers](../../artifacts/v6/iteration-20261007-p05-observation-negative-consumers/report.md). Trace не permission/reclaim |
| IRQ/MMIO/DMA/device/mapping | Original admitted sources и cleanup/no-repeat: [IRQ endpoint-only routing](../../artifacts/v6/iteration-20261008-irq-endpoint-only-route/report.md), [MMIO](../../artifacts/v6/iteration-20261008-mmio-admitted-source-lifetime/report.md), [DMA](../../artifacts/v6/iteration-20261008-dma-admitted-source-lifetime/report.md), [parent mapping](../../artifacts/v6/iteration-20261008-device-mapping-parent-lifetime/report.md). IRQ exit требует live original endpoint owner |
